\f1\b\fs36 \cf0 Things in this logic you may not have realised\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0
\fs24 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Rs.1,000 is not a take-profit.
\f0\b0  Hitting it only switches on the trail. If a trade touches Rs.1,000 and then falls back, it exits at about 
\f1\b Rs.500
\f0\b0 , not Rs.1,000.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Exit rule 4 is dead code.
\f0\b0  Since the SL dropped to Rs.1,000 in v2, the hard SL always fires first, so "loss above Rs.1,000 and the score dropped" can never be reached.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 "Historic success" measures the stock, not the option.
\f0\b0  It counts a 0.5% stock move in 15 min. That doesn't correspond to Rs.1,000 of option profit; with our large quantities, Rs.1,000 often needs only about 0.15%.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Your 7/10 rule only adds points.
\f0\b0  A score of 5 can be reached with historic = 0 (sentiment 2 + volume 2 + sector 1). Every trade so far entered this way.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The IV filter blocks most calm days.
\f0\b0  VIX around 14.5 has been ranking 81\'9688, so on Oct 1, 5, 9 and 13 every single attempt was skipped.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Kite login happens only once, at startup.
\f0\b0  The bot never refreshes its token, so a copy left running past 06:00 the next day turns into the dead "zombie" copy.\
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Three symbols don't exist in Kite's list:
\f0\b0  TATAMOTORS, PEL and LTIM.\
